   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Every accelerator needs HBM, so HBM supply caps how fast anyone can add serving capacity.\nAnthropic runs on all three accelerator families, which hedges against any one supplier running short.",
   "originalText": "Every accelerator needs HBM, so HBM supply caps how fast anyone can add serving capacity.\nAnthropic runs on all three accelerator families, which hedges against any one supplier running short.",
